{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/ed96f6f7929523ef48ce24878785bccc.poster.avif?t=1758496247\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/ed96f6f7929523ef48ce24878785bccc.webm?t=1758496247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/ed96f6f7929523ef48ce24878785bccc.mp4?t=1758496247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It should have been just another ordinary shift underground. But something was terribly wrong. The sounds of mining were replaced by twisted moans\u2026 and your former co-workers are no longer human.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/ad4cd38f840788924af69ae094adbee5.webp?t=1758496247\" width=400 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/ed65971c34d8882ececc69c655411ea7.poster.avif?t=1758496247\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/ed65971c34d8882ececc69c655411ea7.webm?t=1758496247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surviving this shift will be your toughest challenge. Even infected, many miners still cling to their tools now wielded to tear you apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/a3d2f07ec3b14417e567529cc3461f55.webp?t=1758496247\" width=400 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/ce4748e61f20a101ad719738638ebf4f.poster.avif?t=1758496247\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/ce4748e61f20a101ad719738638ebf4f.webm?t=1758496247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/ce4748e61f20a101ad719738638ebf4f.mp4?t=1758496247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daytime is tense. Nightfall is pure despair. When darkness arrives, enemies become faster, more violent, and almost unstoppable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Even in the middle of the apocalypse, the work never ends. Use your tools not only to fight the infected, but to carve paths through rocks, smash crates and barrels, and uncover hidden resources or deadly explosives.</u></i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/414aed11b1498f445f148a2307871f89.webp?t=1758496247\" width=400 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/ab8c8b3317022ef78254167eeabe44df.poster.avif?t=1758496247\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/ab8c8b3317022ef78254167eeabe44df.webm?t=1758496247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/ab8c8b3317022ef78254167eeabe44df.mp4?t=1758496247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run changes everything. Items and escape vehicles spawn in new places, forcing you to adapt. Weapons break. Death is permanent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/6f930cb3f50f2d80f67e51c431a9f1d7.avif?t=1758496247\" width=620 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>\u201cDiamonds are priceless they might buy you a second chance\u2026 but never without a cost.\u201d</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/854224dc4a7c4fc6513f9333b75735e3.webp?t=1758496247\" width=400 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/99cb9b5fa150c71cdd15f2f35a4331a4.poster.avif?t=1758496247\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/99cb9b5fa150c71cdd15f2f35a4331a4.webm?t=1758496247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/99cb9b5fa150c71cdd15f2f35a4331a4.mp4?t=1758496247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some workers mutated into something far worse: massive, stronger, and armored, as if still prepared to mine until their last breath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/31eb6560cd3cb51da90974ba93fd23ca.webp?t=1758496247\" width=400 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/b59b9775c46da7bd02b03202821e8fd8.avif?t=1758496247\" width=620 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Rare chests scattered across the mine can decide your fate. Inside are powerful rewards but both their contents and their cost shift with every attempt, making survival unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/69c6562bbd537231f9629fe2f5a875db.webp?t=1758496247\" width=400 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/b5c7653ddfabb84ed7ef35a095e03382.poster.avif?t=1758496247\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/b5c7653ddfabb84ed7ef35a095e03382.webm?t=1758496247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/b5c7653ddfabb84ed7ef35a095e03382.mp4?t=1758496247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two escapes will ever feel the same. Sometimes quick, sometimes impossible. Luck, strategy, and how you spend your diamonds will determine if you make it out\u2026 or stay buried forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/aba877dbfac63bba0b7561c03b8ace7e.avif?t=1758496247\" width=1252 height=139 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What was once routine has become a nightmare. The darkness hides countless dangers, and every step could be your last. Will you survive another shift?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3968460?t=1758496247","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/0130565169a8af64949a870f59ceb79ca2dcac22/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758496247","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/a83fae4e48de3de06b7ce19788ebac5f73310bbd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758496247","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/a83fae4e48de3de06b7ce19788ebac5f73310bbd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758496247","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968460/extras/ed96f6f7929523ef48ce24878785bccc.poster.avif?t=1758496247\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3